: "repaso", "tr": "wipe"}, {"s": 1485.9333, "e": 1492.5, "k": "A", "off": 516.334, "tr": "wipe"}, {"s": 1492.5, "e": 1504.3667, "k": "S", "sc": "repaso", "tr": "wipe"}, {"s": 1504.3667, "e": 1507.6, "k": "A", "off": 523.064, "tr": "wipe"}, {"s": 1507.6, "e": 1514.0667, "k": "G", "f": "g/g457.png"}, {"s": 1514.0667, "e": 1519.1, "k": "G", "f": "g/g457_list.png"}, {"s": 1519.1, "e": 1526.3667, "k": "G", "f": "g/g458.png"}, {"s": 1526.3667, "e": 1529.2667, "k": "A", "off": 526.454}, {"s": 1529.2667, "e": 1532.9, "k": "G", "f": "g/g461.png"}, {"s": 1532.9, "e": 1541.5, "k": "A", "off": 529.504, "mods": [{"a": 1536.7667, "b": 1541.5, "k": "punch"}]}, {"s": 1541.5, "e": 1547.5667, "k": "G", "f": "g/g464.png"}, {"s": 1547.5667, "e": 1555.3, "k": "G", "f": "g/g464_stopping.png"}, {"s": 1555.3, "e": 1560.7, "k": "A", "off": 538.268}], "ov": [{"k": "Lower", "a": 31.9333, "b": 38.9333, "name": "Linda", "sub": "retired flight attendant · 35 years in the aisle"}, {"k": "Prueba", "a": 196.7333, "b": 204.5667, "txt": "Push it with your foot. Never bend.", "lab": "linda's rule"}, {"k": "Palabra", "a": 224.4667, "b": 230.1667, "kan": "16 oz", "rom": "full, not empty", "sig": "a full one rolls straight"}, {"k": "Kin", "a": 358.1333, "b": 359.1333, "txt": "four seconds", "big": 1}, {"k": "Prueba", "a": 436.4333, "b": 443.0333, "txt": "Door, closet, shower, bed. Then close the door.", "lab": "linda's rule"}, {"k": "Prueba", "a": 490.2667, "b": 499.5333, "txt": "Smile and ask: could I have a different room?", "lab": "linda's rule"}, {"k": "Palabra", "a": 557.1333, "b": 564.8, "kan": "3rd–6th", "rom": "floor", "sig": "not the ground floor, not too high"}, {"k": "Prueba", "a": 590.0333, "b": 594.9333, "txt": "A few doors from the elevator. Away from the ice.", "lab": "linda's rule"}, {"k": "Kin", "a": 629.0333, "b": 630.7, "txt": "one, two, three, four"}, {"k": "Prueba", "a": 648.0333, "b": 654.8667, "txt": "Low, a hand on the wall, count the doors.", "lab": "linda's rule"}, {"k": "Prueba", "a": 742.5667, "b": 750.6667, "txt": "A $2 rubber wedge, skinny end first.", "lab": "linda's rule"}, {"k": "Palabra", "a": 751.5, "b": 753.9333, "kan": "$2", "rom": "rubber door wedge", "sig": "skinny end first", "lado": "izq"}, {"k": "Prueba", "a": 815.1333, "b": 824.2333, "txt": "Hang up and call the front desk yourself.", "lab": "linda's rule"}, {"k": "Prueba", "a": 917.5333, "b": 926.2667, "txt": "Bathroom light on, door open a hand wide.", "lab": "linda's rule"}, {"k": "Kin", "a": 1001.6667, "b": 1002.6333, "txt": "thirty seconds", "big": 1}, {"k": "Prueba", "a": 1057.9, "b": 1066.1333, "txt": "The rack, the tub, or the floor. Never the bed.", "lab": "linda's rule"}, {"k": "Prueba", "a": 1116.4667, "b": 1120.0667, "txt": "Remote, switches, phone, faucets, door handle.", "lab": "linda's rule"}, {"k": "Prueba", "a": 1196.2333, "b": 1200.2667, "txt": "Room number in pencil, on the back of the card.", "lab": "linda's rule"}, {"k": "Kin", "a": 1407.2667, "b": 1408.2, "txt": "Annie was four"}, {"k": "Cta", "a": 1533.1, "b": 1538.5333, "txt": "Which one had you never heard of?"}, {"k": "Cta", "a": 1538.8333, "b": 1541.4, "txt": "Where are you traveling this winter?"}, {"k": "Fin", "a": 1558.5, "b": 1560.7, "sub": "fly safe, my friends"}]}